SessionHistory.description:
History beneath one conversation's immutable captured input. This is not a
resumable object. Provider records retain separate outcomes and driving Processes;
recorder completion is historical evidence, never native success or process exit.

TaskCommentAuthor.description:
Who wrote a comment. Person attribution survives local saves and provider acquisition;
integrations are distinct from participant direction. An agent's direction
is the Session's, written for its requester.

Write.description:
A typed mutation with the same defaults and effects as its CLI spelling.
On the wire each write is a resource-named `kind` (`task.complete`);
`desktop.*` writes are Desktop's own arrangement state.
